---
layout: layout
title: "{dev.talk} - Available Speaker Slots"
description: "Dates and session slots still open for accepted {dev.talk} speakers."
permalink: speaker-slots.html
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
includeBlueskyPosts: false
includeSpeakerSlotsStyles: true
---

<section class="speaker-slots">
  <h1 data-speaker-greeting>Thanks for volunteering to speak at {dev.talk}!</h1>
  <p>Thanks so much for your time and for your interest in speaking at {dev.talk}. We really appreciate you being willing to share your experience with our community. When you're ready, choose an available date and select your preferred email option. A pre-filled email will open for you to review and send. Your date isn't confirmed until we reply.</p>
<p>{dev.talk} events are held in person in the evening between 7pm-9pm at <a href="https://maps.app.goo.gl/T7gidKeBQcE1Cuvk7">Bournemouth University, Talbot Campus</a>.</p>
<p>As we are a community group, we are unable to offer expenses to our speakers.</p>
  <h2>Before you choose</h2>
  <ul class="speaker-slots-help">
    <li>We have a <a href="https://devdottalk.uk/discord">Discord server</a> if you want to join in</li>
    <li><a href="/attending.html">What to expect</a> when you come along</li>
    <li><a href="/code-of-conduct.html">Code of conduct</a></li>
    <li><a href="/previous-events.html">Previous events</a> to get a feel for the evening</li>
    <li><a href="/speakers.html">Meet some of our past speakers</a></li>
    <li><a href="/faqs.html">FAQs</a></li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Available dates</h2>
  <dl class="speaker-slots-who" data-speaker-summary hidden>
    <dt>Speaker</dt>
    <dd data-speaker-name></dd>
    <dt>Session</dt>
    <dd data-speaker-session></dd>
  </dl>

  <ul class="speaker-slots-list">
    {% for ev in events.upcoming | openSpeakerSlots(sessions.allEvents) %}
      <li class="speaker-slots-item">
        <h2>{{ ev.fullDateLabel }}</h2>
        <p>{{ ev.openSlots }} of 2 session slots available</p>
        <div class="speaker-slots-actions">
          <a class="speaker-slots-button" href="mailto:speaker@devdottalk.uk" data-email-action="gmail" data-slot-date="{{ ev.fullDateLabel }}">
            <svg class="speaker-slots-icon" data-button-icon="gmail" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
              <path fill="#EA4335" d="M3 6.5a1.5 1.5 0 0 1 2.4-1.2L12 10l6.6-4.7A1.5 1.5 0 0 1 21 6.5V19h-5V10l-4 2.8L8 10v9H3z"/>
            </svg>
            <span>Gmail</span>
          </a>
          <a class="speaker-slots-button speaker-slots-button--outlook" href="mailto:speaker@devdottalk.uk" data-email-action="outlook" data-slot-date="{{ ev.fullDateLabel }}">
            <svg class="speaker-slots-icon" data-button-icon="outlook" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
              <path fill="#0078D4" d="M3 6h13a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v10a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H3a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2z"/>
              <path fill="#fff" d="m2.5 8 7 5 7-5v2l-7 5-7-5z"/>
              <rect x="14" y="2" width="9" height="13" rx="2" fill="#fff" stroke="#0078D4" stroke-width="1.5"/>
              <text x="18.5" y="11.5" fill="#0078D4" font-family="Arial, sans-serif" font-size="8" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle">O</text>
            </svg>
            <span>Outlook</span>
          </a>
          <a class="speaker-slots-button speaker-slots-button--other" href="mailto:speaker@devdottalk.uk" data-email-action="mailto" data-slot-date="{{ ev.fullDateLabel }}">
            <svg class="speaker-slots-icon" data-button-icon="email" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
              <path fill="currentColor" d="M1.5 4h21A1.5 1.5 0 0 1 24 5.5v13a1.5 1.5 0 0 1-1.5 1.5h-21A1.5 1.5 0 0 1 0 18.5v-13A1.5 1.5 0 0 1 1.5 4Zm0 2v.2l10.5 6.56L22.5 6.2V6h-21Zm21 2.55-10.1 6.31a.75.75 0 0 1-.8 0L1.5 8.55V18.5h21V8.55Z"/>
            </svg>
            <span>Other email app</span>
          </a>
          <button class="speaker-slots-button speaker-slots-button--copy" type="button" data-copy-slot-date="{{ ev.fullDateLabel }}">
            <svg class="speaker-slots-icon" data-button-icon="copy" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
              <path fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.8" d="M8 8V5.5A1.5 1.5 0 0 1 9.5 4h9A1.5 1.5 0 0 1 20 5.5v11a1.5 1.5 0 0 1-1.5 1.5H16M5.5 8h9A1.5 1.5 0 0 1 16 9.5v11a1.5 1.5 0 0 1-1.5 1.5h-9A1.5 1.5 0 0 1 4 20.5v-11A1.5 1.5 0 0 1 5.5 8Z"/>
            </svg>
            <span>Copy details</span>
          </button>
        </div>
        <p class="speaker-slots-copy-status" data-copy-status aria-live="polite"></p>
        <textarea class="speaker-slots-copy-fallback" data-copy-fallback aria-label="Email details to copy" readonly hidden></textarea>
      </li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ul>
</section>

<script src="/speaker-slots.js"></script>
